<section id="l3-cmd">
  <h2 class="section-title">Занятие 3 · Команды и обработчики</h2>
  <h3>3.1 Термины занятия</h3>
  <div class="term-grid">
    <div class="term-card">
      <div class="term-name">Команда</div>
      <div class="term-desc">Слово или фраза, по которой бот выбирает действие.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="term-card">
      <div class="term-name">Нормализация</div>
      <div class="term-desc">Приведение текста к единому виду (убирает пробелы, приводит к одному регистру).</div>
    </div>
    <div class="term-card">
      <div class="term-name">Обработчик</div>
      <div class="term-desc">Функция, которая выполняет реакцию на команду.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="term-card">
      <div class="term-name">Lambda</div>
      <div class="term-desc">Маленькая анонимная (безымянная) функция в одну строчку.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="term-card">
      <div class="term-name">Словарь обработчиков</div>
      <div class="term-desc">Структура, где ключ — команда, а значение — функция-обработчик.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="l3-norm">
  <h3>3.2 Нормализация — функция normalize()</h3>
  <p>Пользователь может написать «ПРИВЕТ», « привет » или «Привет». Для бота это должны быть одна и та же команда. Нормализация приводит всё к единому виду.</p>

  <div class="code-block">
    <div class="code-header"><span class="filename">normalize()</span></div>
<pre>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">1</span><span class="line-code"><span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">normalize</span>(text):</span></span>
<span class="line-comment"># Объявляем функцию с одним параметром text</span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">2</span><span class="line-code">    <span class="kw">return</span> <span class="str">""</span>.<span class="fn">join</span>(text.<span class="fn">lower</span>().<span class="fn">strip</span>().<span class="fn">split</span>())</span></span>
<span class="line-comment"># Цепочка методов (выполняются слева направо, т.е. изнутри наружу):</span>
<span class="line-comment">#   1) text.lower()   → "  ПРИВЕТ  " → "  привет  "</span>
<span class="line-comment">#   2) .strip()       → "  привет  " → "привет"</span>
<span class="line-comment">#   3) .split()       → "привет" → ["привет"]</span>
<span class="line-comment">#   4) "".join(...)   → ["привет"] → "привет"</span>
<span class="line-comment"># Итог: все пробелы убраны, регистр единый</span>
</pre>
  </div>

  <div class="info-box">
    <strong>Зачем <code>.split()</code> + <code>.join()</code>?</strong> <code>.strip()</code> убирает пробелы только по краям. А если пользователь написал «п р и в е т» с пробелами между буквами — связка split/join уберёт их все.
  </div>
</section>

<section id="l3-lambda">
  <h3>3.3 Lambda-функции</h3>
  <p><strong>Lambda</strong> — это маленькая анонимная функция, которая:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>создаётся ключевым словом <code>lambda</code>;</li>
    <li>умещается в одну строчку;</li>
    <li>не требует имени (в отличие от <code>def</code>);</li>
    <li>возвращает результат одного выражения.</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="code-block">
    <div class="code-header"><span class="filename">lambda.py</span></div>
<pre>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">1</span><span class="line-code">sum_two = <span class="kw">lambda</span> x, y: x + y</span></span>
<span class="line-comment"># Разбираем по частям:</span>
<span class="line-comment">#   lambda         — ключевое слово «создай анонимную функцию»</span>
<span class="line-comment">#   x, y           — параметры (входные данные), как в def sum_two(x, y)</span>
<span class="line-comment">#   :              — разделитель между параметрами и телом</span>
<span class="line-comment">#   x + y          — тело функции (ровно одно выражение, return писать не нужно)</span>
<span class="line-comment">#   sum_two = ...  — присваиваем функцию переменной, чтобы можно было вызывать</span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">2</span><span class="line-code"></span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">3</span><span class="line-code"><span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="fn">sum_two</span>(<span class="num">3</span>, <span class="num">5</span>))   <span class="com"># → 8</span></span></span>
</pre>
  </div>

  <h4>Сравнение с обычной функцией:</h4>
  <div class="code-block">
<pre>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">1</span><span class="line-code"><span class="com"># Обычная функция — 2 строки, есть имя</span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">2</span><span class="line-code"><span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">sum_two</span>(x, y):</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">3</span><span class="line-code">    <span class="kw">return</span> x + y</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">4</span><span class="line-code"></span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">5</span><span class="line-code"><span class="com"># Lambda — 1 строка, без имени</span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">6</span><span class="line-code">sum_two = <span class="kw">lambda</span> x, y: x + y</span></span>
</pre>
  </div>

  <div class="info-box success">
    <strong>Когда использовать lambda?</strong> Когда функция очень простая (одно выражение) и нужна «здесь и сейчас» — например, как значение в словаре обработчиков.
  </div>
</section>

<section id="l3-handlers">
  <h3>3.4 Словарь обработчиков</h3>
  <p>Вместо длинной цепочки <code>if / elif / elif</code> мы кладём все команды в словарь, где значение — это функция. Это делает код чище и позволяет легко добавлять новые команды.</p>

  <div class="code-block">
    <div class="code-header"><span class="filename">handlers.py</span></div>
<pre>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">1</span><span class="line-code"><span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">answer_help</span>(vk, peer_id):</span></span>
<span class="line-comment"># Обычная функция-обработчик для команды "помощь"</span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">2</span><span class="line-code">    <span class="fn">send_message</span>(vk, peer_id, <span class="str">"Команды: привет, помощь, идея"</span>)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">3</span><span class="line-code"></span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">4</span><span class="line-code"><span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">answer_idea</span>(vk, peer_id):</span></span>
<span class="line-comment"># Функция-обработчик для команды "идея"</span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">5</span><span class="line-code">    ideas = [<span class="str">"Написать игру"</span>, <span class="str">"Сделать бота-погоду"</span>, <span class="str">"Изучить Django"</span>]</span></span>
<span class="line-comment"># Список идей — выбираем случайную</span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">6</span><span class="line-code">    <span class="fn">send_message</span>(vk, peer_id, random.<span class="fn">choice</span>(ideas))</span></span>
<span class="line-comment"># random.choice(список) — возвращает случайный элемент списка</span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">7</span><span class="line-code"></span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">8</span><span class="line-code">HANDLERS = {</span></span>
<span class="line-comment"># ГЛАВНЫЙ СЛОВАРЬ ОБРАБОТЧИКОВ. Ключ — команда, значение — функция</span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">9</span><span class="line-code">    <span class="str">"помощь"</span>: answer_help,</span></span>
<span class="line-comment"># Ключу "помощь" соответствует функция answer_help (без скобок! — мы кладём саму функцию, а не вызываем её)</span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">10</span><span class="line-code">    <span class="str">"идея"</span>:   answer_idea,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">11</span><span class="line-code">    <span class="str">"привет"</span>: <span class="kw">lambda</span> vk, peer_id: <span class="fn">send_message</span>(vk, peer_id, <span class="str">"Привет!"</span>),</span></span>
<span class="line-comment"># Для коротких команд удобнее lambda — не нужно отдельно объявлять функцию</span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">12</span><span class="line-code">}</span></span>
</pre>
  </div>

  <h4>Как пользоваться словарем в цикле событий:</h4>
  <div class="code-block">
    <div class="code-header"><span class="filename">Использование HANDLERS</span></div>
<pre>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">1</span><span class="line-code">handler = HANDLERS.<span class="fn">get</span>(text)</span></span>
<span class="line-comment"># Ищем обработчик по нормализованному тексту. Если команды нет — handler будет None</span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">2</span><span class="line-code"></span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">3</span><span class="line-code"><span class="kw">if</span> handler:</span></span>
<span class="line-comment"># Если handler существует (не None) — значит, команда найдена</span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">4</span><span class="line-code">    <span class="fn">handler</span>(vk, peer_id)</span></span>
<span class="line-comment"># Вызываем функцию-обработчик, передавая ей vk и peer_id</span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">5</span><span class="line-code"><span class="kw">else</span>:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">6</span><span class="line-code">    <span class="fn">send_message</span>(vk, peer_id, <span class="str">"Не знаю такую команду. Напиши: помощь"</span>)</span></span>
<span class="line-comment"># Если команды нет в словаре — отвечаем запасным сообщением</span>
</pre>
  </div>

  <div class="info-box warn">
    <strong>Важно:</strong> в словаре <code>answer_help</code> пишется БЕЗ скобок. Со скобками <code>answer_help()</code> — это вызов функции (она выполнится сразу). Без скобок — это сама функция как объект.
  </div>
</section>

<section id="l3-full3">
  <h3>3.5 Полный код бота с обработчиками</h3>
  <div class="code-block">
    <div class="code-header"><span class="filename">lesson.py — финальная версия</span></div>
<pre>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num"> 1</span><span class="line-code"><span class="kw">import</span> os</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num"> 2</span><span class="line-code"><span class="kw">import</span> random</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num"> 3</span><span class="line-code"><span class="kw">import</span> vk_api</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num"> 4</span><span class="line-code"><span class="kw">from</span> dotenv <span class="kw">import</span> load_dotenv</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num"> 5</span><span class="line-code"><span class="kw">from</span> vk_api.bot_longpoll <span class="kw">import</span> VkBotEventType, VkBotLongPoll</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num"> 6</span><span class="line-code"></span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num"> 7</span><span class="line-code"><span class="fn">load_dotenv</span>()</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num"> 8</span><span class="line-code">TOKEN = os.<span class="fn">getenv</span>(<span class="str">"VK_GROUP_TOKEN"</span>)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num"> 9</span><span class="line-code">GROUP_ID = <span class="fn">int</span>(os.<span class="fn">getenv</span>(<span class="str">"VK_GROUP_ID"</span>, <span class="str">"0"</span>))</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">10</span><span class="line-code"></span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">11</span><span class="line-code"><span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">normalize</span>(text):</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">12</span><span class="line-code">    <span class="kw">return</span> <span class="str">""</span>.<span class="fn">join</span>(text.<span class="fn">lower</span>().<span class="fn">strip</span>().<span class="fn">split</span>())</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">13</span><span class="line-code"></span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">14</span><span class="line-code"><span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">send_message</span>(vk, peer_id, text):</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">15</span><span class="line-code">    vk.messages.<span class="fn">send</span>(</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">16</span><span class="line-code">        peer_id=peer_id,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">17</span><span class="line-code">        message=text,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">18</span><span class="line-code">        random_id=random.<span class="fn">randint</span>(<span class="num">1</span>, <span class="num">2_147_483_647</span>),</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">19</span><span class="line-code">    )</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">20</span><span class="line-code"></span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">21</span><span class="line-code"><span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">answer_help</span>(vk, peer_id):</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">22</span><span class="line-code">    <span class="fn">send_message</span>(vk, peer_id, <span class="str">"Команды: привет, помощь, идея"</span>)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">23</span><span class="line-code"></span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">24</span><span class="line-code"><span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">answer_idea</span>(vk, peer_id):</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">25</span><span class="line-code">    ideas = [<span class="str">"Написать игру"</span>, <span class="str">"Сделать бота-погоду"</span>, <span class="str">"Изучить Django"</span>]</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">26</span><span class="line-code">    <span class="fn">send_message</span>(vk, peer_id, random.<span class="fn">choice</span>(ideas))</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">27</span><span class="line-code"></span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">28</span><span class="line-code">HANDLERS = {</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">29</span><span class="line-code">    <span class="str">"помощь"</span>: answer_help,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">30</span><span class="line-code">    <span class="str">"идея"</span>:   answer_idea,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">31</span><span class="line-code">    <span class="str">"привет"</span>: <span class="kw">lambda</span> vk, peer_id: <span class="fn">send_message</span>(vk, peer_id, <span class="str">"Привет!"</span>),</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">32</span><span class="line-code">}</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">33</span><span class="line-code"></span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">34</span><span class="line-code"><span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">main</span>():</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">35</span><span class="line-code">    <span class="kw">if</span> <span class="kw">not</span> TOKEN <span class="kw">or</span> GROUP_ID == <span class="num">0</span>:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">36</span><span class="line-code">        <span class="kw">raise</span> <span class="fn">RuntimeError</span>(<span class="str">"Заполните VK_GROUP_TOKEN и VK_GROUP_ID в .env"</span>)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">37</span><span class="line-code"></span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">38</span><span class="line-code">    vk_session = vk_api.<span class="fn">VkApi</span>(token=TOKEN)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">39</span><span class="line-code">    vk = vk_session.<span class="fn">get_api</span>()</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">40</span><span class="line-code">    longpoll = <span class="fn">VkBotLongPoll</span>(vk_session, GROUP_ID)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">41</span><span class="line-code">    <span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">"Бот запущен"</span>)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">42</span><span class="line-code"></span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">43</span><span class="line-code">    <span class="kw">for</span> event <span class="kw">in</span> longpoll.<span class="fn">listen</span>():</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">44</span><span class="line-code">        <span class="kw">if</span> event.type != VkBotEventType.MESSAGE_NEW:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">45</span><span class="line-code">            <span class="kw">continue</span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">46</span><span class="line-code"></span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">47</span><span class="line-code">        message = event.object.message</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">48</span><span class="line-code">        text = <span class="fn">normalize</span>(message.<span class="fn">get</span>(<span class="str">"text"</span>, <span class="str">""</span>))</span></span>
<span class="line-comment"># Теперь используем нашу функцию normalize вместо цепочки strip().lower()</span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">49</span><span class="line-code">        peer_id = message[<span class="str">"peer_id"</span>]</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">50</span><span class="line-code"></span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">51</span><span class="line-code">        handler = HANDLERS.<span class="fn">get</span>(text)</span></span>
<span class="line-comment"># Ищем функцию-обработчик по команде</span>
<span class="line"><span class="line-num">52</span><span class="line-code">        <span class="kw">if</span> handler:</span></span>
